## SQ-BBQ-01 | Barbeque's Delight member loads, no recipe or compost warning
@group A
@commands Boot; `grep -n "barbequesdelight" logs/latest.log \| grep -i "error\|exception\|failed to parse\|missing" \| head`; `grep -n "barbequesdelight\|bbq" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log \| grep -i "warn\|error" \| head`
@pass mod `barbequesdelight` loads from the CD jar (`creativedelight_members.txt`); no recipe parse errors; no NCH warning for the 26 recipes; no compost warning for the 24 rows
@fails `CampfireRainInfo` missing (Creative Common old); an unknown item key in `recipes.js`
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb passed
@reviewed 2026-11-20
bootexpect \[creativedelight\] members: \[.*\bbarbequesdelight\b
bootreject (?i)barbequesdelight.*(exception|failed to parse|missing)
kjsreject (?i)(warn|error).*(barbequesdelight|bbqSkewering|bbqGrilling|bbqCombine)
shell grep -hn "barbequesdelight\|bbq" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log | grep -i "warn\|error" | head; true

## SQ-BBQ-02 | Barbeque's recipes: 28 skewering and grilling, all creativedelight ids; no combine; basin and tray per wood
@group A
@commands Recipe lookup: types `barbequesdelight:skewering` (10), `barbequesdelight:grilling` (18 = 10 Barbeque's Delight lines + 8 pack raw skewers), no `barbequesdelight:combine` (plan_meals_rolls_bbq.md C8: combos are shaped / assembly recipes); ids `creativedelight:shaped/bbq_grill`, `creativedelight:stonecutting/bbq_<wood>_basin_from_logs` and `bbq_<wood>_tray_from_logs` (9 woods each, barbeques_delight.md 3.11)
@pass 28 recipes, all `creativedelight:` ids; none under `barbequesdelight:` (the port ships no recipe data); no combine recipe; 9 basin and 9 tray stonecutting recipes; skewering inputs are the `forge:` tags of 3.1 (beef: 2 `#forge:raw_beef` + 2 `#forge:crops/cabbage`)
@fails NCH emitters missing (Creative Common jar not rebuilt). Counts from kubejs/exported/recipes/all.csv 2026-11-19 (skewering 10, grilling 18, combine 0, 18 bbq_*_from_logs); r1120lr batch fault: row predated C8 and 3.11
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-20
> cdevtest rdetail creativedelight:skewering/
> cdevtest rdetail creativedelight:grilling/ max=100
> cdevtest recipes creativedelight:combine/
> cdevtest recipes barbequesdelight:
> cdevtest rdetail bbq_grill
> cdevtest rdetail _basin_from_logs max=50
> cdevtest rdetail _tray_from_logs max=50
