count verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:grilling/\S+ serializer= == 18
expect verb=recipes text=creativedelight:combine/ n=0\b
expect verb=recipes text=barbequesdelight: n=0\b
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:shaped/bbq_grill serializer=
