@group A
@commands Bot: place a grill on a placed campfire (`/setblock` campfire then use the grill item on it); `/data get block` / block state; `/setblock ~ ~-1 ~ minecraft:stone`, `/weather rain`, light it with flint and steel, wait 200 ticks; repeat on `minecraft:coal_block`
@pass state `has_campfire=true,lit=false` on placing; lit by flint and steel (light 15); out in rain after `rainOutTicks` (160) on stone; still lit on the coal block; breaking drops the grill and a campfire
@fails rain rule: grill not in `rain_douses`, or Creative Compat not filling CampfireRainInfo
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-20
